      "machineText": "今天，[Wails](https://wails.io) v2 正式发布。距离首个 v2 Alpha 版本发布大约已有18个月，距离首个 Beta 版本发布也已有大约一年。我由衷感谢参与推动项目发展的每一个人。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Today marks the release of [Wails](https://wails.io) v2. It's been about 18\\ months since the first …",
