    "b0027-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "f88f4527e5f731cd5c8b2b3b15c6dc2beb9d8b928344981cc2fa217a4749b727",
      "targetHash": "937a65b30422172bf9a723ccbabd32c8f648b8934c773d253260f9b8d867f726",
      "machineHash": "937a65b30422172bf9a723ccbabd32c8f648b8934c773d253260f9b8d867f726",
      "machineText": "首先，向 [@stffabi](https://github.com/stffabi) 致以*万分*感谢。他做出了许多让我们所有人受益的贡献，还为许多问题提供了大量支持。他实现了一些关键功能，例如外部开发服务器支持；这让我们能够利用[Vite](https://vitejs.dev/)的强大能力，从而彻底改变了我们的开发模式。可以毫不夸张地说，如果没有他的[杰出贡献](https://github.com/wailsapp/wails/commits?author=stffabi\u0026since=2020-01-04)，Wails v2 绝不会是现在这样令人振奋的版本。非常感谢你，@stffabi！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Firstly, a *huge* thank you to [@stffabi](https://github.com/stffabi) who has\\ provided so many cont…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0028-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "a580b12dc1f4af1f94f8d6f9c15f96963daccab598d8dc16b976968034cfb5a0",
      "targetHash": "e1f062dba4a30fe2e8ac356b3548f9d9a858d4c463386f5fd9fe7b10765ebb50",
      "machineHash": "e1f062dba4a30fe2e8ac356b3548f9d9a858d4c463386f5fd9fe7b10765ebb50",
      "machineText": "我还要特别感谢 [@misitebao](https://github.com/misitebao)。他不辞辛劳地维护网站、提供中文翻译、管理 Crowdin，并帮助新译者快速上手。这是一项极其重要的工作，我由衷感谢为此投入的所有时间和精力！你太棒了！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "I'd also like to give a huge shout-out to\\ [@misitebao](https://github.com/misitebao) who has tirele…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0029-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "81b347e42070cd5d325910c5e0a94c0fcfe9b749920fa01eb4d10168ead32dd8",
      "targetHash": "264cefe55e6e704ca3f2c34ae1f3208cd418ba66725f9b49fac14ac260c326bb",
      "machineHash": "264cefe55e6e704ca3f2c34ae1f3208cd418ba66725f9b49fac14ac260c326bb",
      "machineText": "最后同样重要的是，我要衷心感谢 Mat Ryer 在 v2 开发期间提供的建议和支持。我们曾使用 v2 的早期 Alpha 版本共同开发 xBar，这不仅帮助确定了 v2 的发展方向，也让我认识到早期版本中的一些设计缺陷。我很高兴地宣布，从今天起，我们将开始把 xBar 移植到 Wails v2，它也将成为本项目的旗舰应用。谢谢你，Mat！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Last, but not least, a huge thank you to Mat Ryer who has provided advice and\\ support during the de…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0030-heading-01": {
      "sourceHash": "a5a19ce0ba93ef361f16457839441bb17edbf415aa0545afb874ade1b4d79b4a",
      "targetHash": "2e2dff2b393e2f280341b9785c1d1667e30b83e24c1e6913daba5f7484ff8874",
      "machineHash": "2e2dff2b393e2f280341b9785c1d1667e30b83e24c1e6913daba5f7484ff8874",
      "machineText": "经验教训",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Lessons Learnt",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0031-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "a581944e822b7b316adfa3e984b634bdf411ce5718b4fd18d1a31a388ce648c9",
      "targetHash": "3b24a4ee0718e6717207ac6f9253c53b183ac5023f0c219dc642dfb7230ba8c6",
      "machineHash": "3b24a4ee0718e6717207ac6f9253c53b183ac5023f0c219dc642dfb7230ba8c6",
      "machineText": "在迈向 v2 的过程中，我们吸取了许多经验教训，它们将影响今后的开发方向。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "There are a number of lessons learnt in getting to v2 that will shape\\ development moving forward.",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0032-heading-01": {
      "sourceHash": "dae7dda52c4b3bf7805773edf5f3b92478485fd18089515af4942c6a068788bc",
      "targetHash": "26428b0e5448a291d1069aa1297f1fe986817e036bd3316b3643abd44ab81154",
      "machineHash": "26428b0e5448a291d1069aa1297f1fe986817e036bd3316b3643abd44ab81154",
      "machineText": "规模更小、节奏更快、目标更明确的版本",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Smaller, Quicker, Focused Releases",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0033-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "c3165e909facb57df991d4f58a92863d1e2b0636f5c1b2189fba3e9cf9d0661b",
      "targetHash": "e18de9942ed2f0aaafbd333e313af5a70bda57f302a1b5c95b84684a1f7ca024",
      "machineHash": "e18de9942ed2f0aaafbd333e313af5a70bda57f302a1b5c95b84684a1f7ca024",
      "machineText": "在开发 v2 的过程中，许多功能和错误修复都是临时开展的。这导致发布周期更长，调试也更加困难。今后，我们将更频繁地发布版本，每个版本包含的功能数量会减少。每次发布都将包括文档更新和全面测试。希望这些规模更小、节奏更快、目标更明确的版本能够减少回归问题，并带来质量更高的文档。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "In the course of developing v2, there were many features and bug fixes that were\\ developed on an ad…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0034-heading-01": {
      "sourceHash": "ba39172309f2362bc49ffdd644d64ac71c62f6bfda72da1cbcab9cff246918d5",
      "targetHash": "a89558af6e1f8258091298c2273c0103fe0289b12ba9f69fff9b2a43459d7c86",
      "machineHash": "a89558af6e1f8258091298c2273c0103fe0289b12ba9f69fff9b2a43459d7c86",
      "machineText": "鼓励参与",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Encourage Engagement",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0035-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "b67dec378990635f93cf69604fb3c742cf35374207535e4e43f8d5f0b1e6eaff",
      "targetHash": "37c26abd48f56c03c4822ffe8fe6362b5ca76537b2780eeaf6b3733743300bde",
      "machineHash": "37c26abd48f56c03c4822ffe8fe6362b5ca76537b2780eeaf6b3733743300bde",
      "machineText": "刚开始这个项目时，我希望立即帮助每一个遇到问题的人。我把每个问题都当成“自己的事”，想尽快解决。这种做法不可持续，最终反而不利于项目的长久发展。今后，我会为其他人参与回答问题和分类处理议题留出更多空间。如果能有一些工具协助完成这些工作会很有帮助，因此如果你有任何建议，请在[此处](https://github.com/wailsapp/wails/discussions/1855)参与讨论。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "When starting this project, I wanted to immediately help everyone who had a\\ problem. Issues were \"p…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0036-heading-01": {
      "sourceHash": "bf83061ce48f1f89b25affd0418d23d3c7a97af8d162041b66cd93c2b172b835",
      "targetHash": "2bfeb750fab2dbc249c1e89d74c9220554c90a7ee4b32778a78782013f4bf302",
      "machineHash": "2bfeb750fab2dbc249c1e89d74c9220554c90a7ee4b32778a78782013f4bf302",
      "machineText": "学会说“不”",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Learning to say No",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0037-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "751c2e458261e331690d722dd5227f843356ac950a24a347320825b3c1874b29",
      "targetHash": "7e1a6880280dd29bd652a763aa3a0df92eb0168525087c6e0713e0f6efd1b80c",
      "machineHash": "7e1a6880280dd29bd652a763aa3a0df92eb0168525087c6e0713e0f6efd1b80c",
      "machineText": "参与开源项目的人越多，要求增加新功能的请求就越多，而这些功能对大多数人而言可能有用，也可能没用。开发和调试这些功能需要前期投入时间，此后还会持续产生维护成本。在这方面，我自己最为严重：我常常想要“大包大揽”，而不是先提供最小可行的功能。今后，对于向核心添加功能的请求，我们需要更常说“不”，并把精力集中在如何让开发者自行实现这些功能上。我们正在认真考虑通过插件来满足这种场景。这样，任何人都能按自己的需求扩展项目，同时也能方便地为项目作出贡献。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "The more people that engage with an Open Source project, the more requests there\\ will be for additi…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0038-heading-01": {
      "sourceHash": "c19ed0fe6cde617e1042e81a301f6e011252608915f926fd84743855c9cd1ab7",
      "targetHash": "87ceaa73b2344aad3c7bd0fa9b0ec41a53ae336a64e243d8d48e5287d8844d07",
      "machineHash": "87ceaa73b2344aad3c7bd0fa9b0ec41a53ae336a64e243d8d48e5287d8844d07",
      "machineText": "展望未来",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Looking to the Future",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0039-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "2f971e0931f1700835c64a1c74c59f5e9afa8553d2996071bea044f785795b96",
      "targetHash": "481f845f10ba1148a271cc1e9be703b1c71d4dd72d2503ef6e25f50036510cdc",
      "machineHash": "481f845f10ba1148a271cc1e9be703b1c71d4dd72d2503ef6e25f50036510cdc",
      "machineText": "我们已经在考虑下一个主要开发周期中要为 Wails 添加的众多核心功能。[路线图](https://github.com/wailsapp/wails/discussions/1484)中充满了有趣的想法，我迫不及待地想开始着手实现。其中呼声很高的一项是多窗口支持。这是个棘手的问题，要想妥善实现，我们可能需要考虑提供一套替代 API，因为当前 API 在设计之初并未考虑这一需求。根据一些初步构想和反馈，我想你会喜欢我们正在探索的方向。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "There are so many core features we are looking at to add to Wails in the next\\ major development cyc…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0040-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "fd9e8cbe278fe80f9c4c44821b417ef7d955ca6267829a54d704d501f5532a2e",
      "targetHash": "3fc9b68596bc2f2d1d63f6e1da7dc0dd88efb322deab80b71ac036a39fb5c2f4",
      "machineHash": "3fc9b68596bc2f2d1d63f6e1da7dc0dd88efb322deab80b71ac036a39fb5c2f4",
      "machineText": "我个人非常期待让 Wails 应用在移动设备上运行。我们已经有一个演示项目，证明 Wails 应用可以在 Android 上运行，因此我非常想探索这方面还能走多远！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "I'm personally very excited at the prospect of getting Wails apps running on\\ mobile. We already hav…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0041-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "5afa7ed97946b3b73a54d74363265a716ec7602ed2df8345a758b6b57de1968f",
      "targetHash": "068fba0cd5a3dd9d31288b552a1321b877a96867b427054c3630134e0ba4c5e5",
      "machineHash": "068fba0cd5a3dd9d31288b552a1321b877a96867b427054c3630134e0ba4c5e5",
      "machineText": "最后，我想谈谈功能一致性。长期以来，我们一直坚持一项核心原则：除非某项功能能够获得完整的跨平台支持，否则就不会将其添加到项目中。尽管到目前为止，这一点（基本上）能够做到，但它确实阻碍了项目发布新功能。今后，我们将采用稍有不同的方式：任何无法立即面向所有平台发布的新功能，都将通过实验性配置或 API 发布。这样，特定平台上的早期采用者便可试用该功能并提供反馈，这些反馈将用于完善该功能的最终设计。当然，这意味着在该功能获得所有能够支持它的平台的完整支持之前，API 的稳定性无法得到保证，但至少不会再阻碍开发。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "A final point I'd like to raise is that of feature parity. It has long been a\\ core principle that w…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0042-heading-01": {
      "sourceHash": "f07b1fc1d5568637ab8911cb39c530374eb64d13878d0d7eafeb80fcb4425818",
      "targetHash": "ef738eaa21fe871f08ffe092bc8ea4710700f188c43aee83f182124932507ca0",
      "machineHash": "ef738eaa21fe871f08ffe092bc8ea4710700f188c43aee83f182124932507ca0",
      "machineText": "最后的话",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Final Words",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0043-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "771dc68ccdba395d627e43426c56a5d9e16702f5c743c314189fdb27497217fc",
      "targetHash": "8f2a0c0e718c2e7ed5965c9640c372e5b7504367db1c668cab7bea9367c2d04d",
      "machineHash": "8f2a0c0e718c2e7ed5965c9640c372e5b7504367db1c668cab7bea9367c2d04d",
      "machineText": "我为我们在 V2 版本中取得的成果感到无比自豪。看到大家迄今已经使用各个测试版构建出诸如[Varly](https://varly.app/)、[Surge](https://getsurge.io/)和[October](https://october.utf9k.net/)这样的优质应用，实在令人赞叹。我推荐你去体验一下。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "I'm really proud of what we've been able to achieve with the V2 release. It's\\ amazing to see what p…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0044-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "76117fbff80cfbbc2b0089644e7bf6c5ef5bbc30ea758447e4410b7f1c901fd2",
      "targetHash": "674b4fa26aaa83a02850459c24ec7159c18d3d0d64a7943e291a434733c700ee",
      "machineHash": "674b4fa26aaa83a02850459c24ec7159c18d3d0d64a7943e291a434733c700ee",
      "machineText": "此版本凝聚了众多贡献者的辛勤付出。虽然它可以免费下载和使用，但并非毫无成本。毫无疑问，这个项目付出了相当大的代价。不仅包括我和每一位贡献者投入的时间，也包括我们每个人因此无法陪伴亲友所付出的代价。因此，我对投入这个项目的每一分每一秒都深怀感激。贡献者越多，这份工作就越能由更多人分担，我们共同取得的成就也会越大。我想鼓励大家选择一件力所能及的事来贡献，无论是确认他人报告的 bug、提出修复建议、修改文档，还是帮助有需要的人。所有这些小事都能产生巨大的影响！如果你也能成为迈向 v3 这段历程的一员，那就太棒了。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "This release was achieved through the hard work of many contributors. Whilst it\\ is free to download…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0045-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "b8f291487a0c82eb3a266c76043d219d2a8141c9931395b5494677b8412d4127",
      "targetHash": "16b297a13b1f43f6ede0a1e67508d98bccd61b1be3893ba5097c5e552bf5f4f3",
      "machineHash": "16b297a13b1f43f6ede0a1e67508d98bccd61b1be3893ba5097c5e552bf5f4f3",
      "machineText": "尽情享用吧！",
      "status": "final",
